  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stabilization Amplification Mechanism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to stability and peace in Somalia by creating conditions for restoring trust horizontally, between communities, and vertically, between communities and local leadership. Building on lessons learned from previous IOM projects in Somalia, this project&apos;s interventions incorporate years of best practices to deliver the Organization&apos;s integrated stabilization strategy, which is optimized by a combination of local presence/access, multi-sectoral expertise, and nuanced contextual acumen. The ultimate goal is to support the rebuilding of the social contract between Somali citizens and State institutions and providing a bridge to longer-term development interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
